rong>DISCLOSED (composite-heterogeneity note)</strong></td></tr><tr><td>38184150</td><td>Major vascular events / MACE</td><td>OMEGA-REMODEL: idiosyncratic composite (all-cause death/HF-hosp/ACS/CABG, no stroke or CV death), 6-mo pilot. Â·both families</td><td><strong>REFUSED (declared absent)</strong></td></tr></table></div>",
