Most decisions will separate cleanly into three buckets: true eligible RCTs without protocol outcomes, secondary analyses/duplicate reports of already-accounted landmark trials, and records whose population/intervention/comparator is off-scope. I’m pulling decision-bearing sentences now so the final JSON quotes stay short and auditable.
